{"authors": [], "discovered_at": "2026-08-10T23:42:55.050291Z", "id": "github:release:787462297:release:368193503", "kind": "release", "matched_terms": [], "metadata": {"action": "released", "draft": false, "forks": 711, "prerelease": false, "stars": 5318, "stars_delta": 9, "tag_name": "v0.6.12"}, "organization": "Blaizzy", "priority": {"source": 0.5}, "published_at": "2026-08-10T20:57:47Z", "related_items": [], "scores": {}, "source": "github", "source_id": "787462297:release:368193503", "summary": "## What's Changed\r\n* Fix LFM tool call parsing and bump version to 0.6.11 by @Blaizzy in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1792\r\n* Fix Qwen3.5 ragged decode on GPUs that reject a 1024-thread threadgroup by @neil0306 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1799\r\n* fix(quant): honor per-layer quantization overrides for wrapped text models by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1791\r\n* Fix Qwen3.5 structured output on checkpoints with a padded vocab by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1805\r\n* Add qwen3 text backbone support to llmjpvl (Jagle-VL) by @takuyaomi in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1801\r\n* feat(speculative): validate Laguna DFlash contract by @Thump604 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1753\r\n* server: add --max-num-seqs to bound concurrent batch size by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1782\r\n* Honor explicit trust_remote_code in processor from_pretrained by @camparker in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1731\r\n* Fix /v1/responses image reference output by @lucasnewman in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1806\r\n* test: cover Chandra OCR2 config on the qwen3_5 path (#39) by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1809\r\n* Split unterminated reasoning correctly when the prompt opens the thinking block  by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1811\r\n* embedding_loader: quantize pre-quantized weights before loading by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1773\r\n* Add support for Minimax-H3 by @lucasnewman in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1808\r\n* Keep serving when an optional model preload fails by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1814\r\n* Quick fix to properly recoginze Bonsai Image models. by @dcartman in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1816\r\n* Configure KV cache quantization per tensor by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1807\r\n* Add Muse Glimmer model support by @Blaizzy in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1838\r\n* Add Muse Glimmer ATEM tool parser by @Blaizzy in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1841\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @camparker made their first contribution in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1731\r\n* @dcartman made their first contribution in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/1816\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/compare/v0.6.10...v0.6.12", "title": "Blaizzy/mlx-vlm v0.6.12", "topics": ["vision_language_models"], "updated_at": "2026-08-10T20:57:47Z", "url": "https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/releases/tag/v0.6.12", "venue": null}
